<title>KUWAIT: Ansaldo wins $30.2mln Kuwait station deal.</title>
<headline>Ansaldo wins $30.2mln Kuwait station deal.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Ansaldo will sign a deal worth 9.130 million dinars ($30.2 million) with Kuwait's Electricity and Water Ministry to build an electricity sub-station, a representative of the firm said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal will be signed in a few days,&quot; the firm official said of the deal which involves supplying the sub-station's equipment and installtion.</p>
<p>The sub-station will be build at al-Shegaya area west of Kuwait City.</p>
<p>($1 = 0.302 dinar)</p>
</text>
